# Open Persona on Hetzner: the self-hosted LiveKit SFU (compose profile selfhosted-livekit).
# TEMPLATE: tokens are explained in common.env.example. Never put a real value here.
# Unused when voice runs on LiveKit Cloud.
#
# packages/livekit/entrypoint.sh reads both. The key pair is the one voice signs tokens
# with (voice.env PERSONA_VOICE_LIVEKIT_API_KEY / _API_SECRET).
LIVEKIT_KEYS=__GEN_LIVEKIT_API_KEY__: __GEN_LIVEKIT_API_SECRET__
# The box's public IPv4, advertised as the ICE candidate. Setting it explicitly is what
# skips the entrypoint's Fly-only `$FLY_APP_NAME.fly.dev` lookup.
LIVEKIT_NODE_IP=__GEN_NODE_IP__
